Sokha's family travelled abroad for the first time. A travel agent helped them get a visa for Japan. At the airport, they waited at the departure gate until boarding started. In the arrival hall in Tokyo, a friend met them. They had a great sightseeing day, but one shop was a tourist trap: everything was very expensive!

